{"synopsis":"Kisah ini berpusat pada Su Bai, yang memanfaatkan Clock of All Things untuk memperkuat skill dan meningkatkan perlengkapannya, terus-menerus memecahkan rekor dalam kompetisi tower climbing PvP berskala global. Alur cerita mencakup kemajuan profesi, perebutan “first kill”, dan perang antar-ras. Dengan menaklukkan dungeon di setiap lantai menara, Su Bai membangun sistem kekuatannya sendiri dan mengungkap dunia tempat Tower of God menghubungkan berbagai dimensi. Seiring waktu, sang protagonis secara bertahap membangkitkan kemampuan seperti kekuatan waktu dan necromancy, mendorong alur utama perjuangan umat manusia di Blue Star (Bumi) untuk bertahan hidup dari serangan peradaban tingkat tinggi.","alternative_title":"最強神ゲーマー、再び999階層ダンジョンをクリアさせていただきます","author":"地中海达咩","artist":"纵横中文网","chapters":[{"number":"65","chapter":"65","slug":"57e87ae4-3843-43bd-b8ea-aef5f92250cb","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"89481c63-c1e8-45ca-a0e0-fa29dab0cca2","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"fa439f8e-35ff-49a7-b58f-dd5002594b42","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-07-23"},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"fbf0dcaa-e0b4-4651-bc28-a5a35a7b6a44","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-07-17"},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"5d273eae-2809-41ed-aeb7-055119871c48","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-07-09"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"13135d64-d9b9-4458-bbf7-ffe2a25a1c07","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-07-02"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"ac7c47d9-4b10-4a1e-b2b1-fec0549ff914","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-06-25"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"a667ff9c-567e-47b5-a966-00045ad5558b","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-06-18"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"e09b88f1-eaf1-4768-99bb-e603391df3f2","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-06-11"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"0210903c-9210-46bd-b66d-f503bef4f070","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-06-11"},{"nu